WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:30.958
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:34.500
Lord Krishna explained
 about those four types of people

3
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.916
who walk on the path of surrender to Krishna.

4
00:00:37.916 --> 00:00:40.291
Now here, Lord Krishna explains

5
00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:42.333
which among these four people

6
00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:46.250
is most dear to Him, and why.

7
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.208
Lord Krishna says

8
00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:54.750
that among the four types of people

9
00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.708
who come to His shelter,

10
00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:59.750
the best are jñānī,

11
00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:02.916
who remain always absorbed
 in Krishna devotion.

12
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:04.041
Where on one hand

13
00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:05.875
Krishna is extremely

14
00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:08.875
dear to those jñānīs, there

15
00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:11.875
those people are equally dear to Krishna.

16
00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:13.166
This is because

17
00:01:13.166 --> 00:01:14.791
a jñānī is free from all

18
00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:17.000
material desires

19
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.625
and wants to serve Krishna only

20
00:01:18.625 --> 00:01:22.166
with pure feeling of love.

21
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:23.958
The other three categories also

22
00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:25.833
turn toward Krishna,

23
00:01:25.833 --> 00:01:26.500
but

24
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.625
behind this, some

25
00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:30.041
personal gain is involved.

26
00:01:30.041 --> 00:01:32.583
Some people turn toward Krishna

27
00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:35.625
for relief from sorrow, 

28
00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:39.291
some for material desire of wealth/property,

29
00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:41.333
or some to satisfy their mind's curiosity.

30
00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:44.375
But jñānī surrenders to Krishna

31
00:01:44.375 --> 00:01:46.416
neither for material gain

32
00:01:46.416 --> 00:01:48.208
nor for any curiosity.

33
00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.625
They have understood

34
00:01:49.625 --> 00:01:52.208
that before Krishna,

35
00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:53.750
no material thing in this material world,

36
00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:57.833
or any other happiness is worth obtaining at all.

37
00:01:57.833 --> 00:01:58.666
Therefore,

38
00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:00.583
they engage their heart

39
00:02:00.583 --> 00:02:02.708
in complete devotion to Krishna.

40
00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:06.416
And this is called eka-bhakti in this verse.

41
00:02:06.416 --> 00:02:10.000
Such devotion that is focused, unbroken.

42
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.541
A jñānī knows

43
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:13.458
that beyond this material world

44
00:02:13.458 --> 00:02:17.083
there's a supreme truth, which
 is Lord Krishna Himself.

45
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:20.125
They desire to connect with that truth.

46
00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:22.500
And because of this very deep sentiment,

47
00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.500
Krishna gives jñānī a high place.

48
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.250
Where other people

49
00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.750
come to Krishna for solution of their
 problem or for selfishness,

50
00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.166
and then when the problem is solved,

51
00:02:32.166 --> 00:02:34.208
when selfishness is fulfilled,

52
00:02:34.208 --> 00:02:36.250
they forget Krishna.

53
00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.208
There, a jñānī, without

54
00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:41.291
any material desire,

55
00:02:41.291 --> 00:02:43.708
remains constantly engaged
 in Lord Krishna's service.

56
00:02:43.708 --> 00:02:48.291
This is the purity of devotion,
 which is beyond every vice.

57
00:02:48.291 --> 00:02:49.916
And this very purity creates

58
00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:52.166
such a mutual relationship of love

59
00:02:52.166 --> 00:02:55.541
between Krishna and His supreme devotees,

60
00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:58.916
where both become extremely dear

61
00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:00.291
to each other.

62
00:03:05.208 --> 00:03:07.500
A very big lesson

63
00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.416
of personal life

64
00:03:09.416 --> 00:03:13.333
is hidden in this verse.

65
00:03:13.333 --> 00:03:15.416
And it's hidden

66
00:03:15.416 --> 00:03:19.791
in a jñānī's perspective.

67
00:03:19.791 --> 00:03:21.833
A jñānī

68
00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:25.833
loves Me selflessly,

69
00:03:25.833 --> 00:03:29.166
is surrendered to Me

70
00:03:29.166 --> 00:03:34.916
because of a deep spiritual purpose. And this

71
00:03:34.916 --> 00:03:39.541
makes their devotion unbreakable.

72
00:03:39.541 --> 00:03:41.416
And if

73
00:03:41.416 --> 00:03:44.750
they're dear to Me,

74
00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.916
then doesn't this mean

75
00:03:47.916 --> 00:03:50.375
they've also attained

76
00:03:50.375 --> 00:03:54.208
their spiritual purpose?

77
00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:59.708
Higher purpose and selfless love.

78
00:03:59.708 --> 00:04:01.500
These two things

79
00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.708
apply to many aspects

80
00:04:04.708 --> 00:04:06.416
of personal life.

81
00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:09.833
Just take mutual relationships.

82
00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:14.125
If a relationship happens due to selfishness,

83
00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:16.375
then it will soon break too.

84
00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:20.916
But there, if your purpose is pure,

85
00:04:20.916 --> 00:04:24.750
you respect a person

86
00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.583
not for some trivial craving,

87
00:04:26.583 --> 00:04:30.458
but only because of their personality,

88
00:04:30.458 --> 00:04:34.041
then this relationship will remain permanent.

89
00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:38.166
And you'll also receive mutual love.

90
00:04:38.166 --> 00:04:41.791
Just take other decisions of life.

91
00:04:41.791 --> 00:04:46.041
When you take life's decisions

92
00:04:46.041 --> 00:04:47.958
for a true purpose,

93
00:04:47.958 --> 00:04:48.750
then

94
00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:52.500
automatically firmness awakens in the mind.

95
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:56.000
You remain steadfast even in difficulties.

96
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.958
For example,

97
00:04:57.958 --> 00:05:02.625
if you do some job only for money,

98
00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:06.750
then with time you'll start getting tired.

99
00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:11.916
Dissatisfaction will awaken
 in the mind, you'll waver.

100
00:05:11.916 --> 00:05:13.791
But there,

101
00:05:13.791 --> 00:05:18.041
if you do something

102
00:05:18.041 --> 00:05:21.333
that's connected to a deep life purpose,

103
00:05:21.333 --> 00:05:24.416
toward which you have selfless love,

104
00:05:24.416 --> 00:05:27.208
not just selfishness of money,

105
00:05:27.208 --> 00:05:32.083
then in such work there'll be neither
 tiredness nor dissatisfaction.

106
00:05:32.083 --> 00:05:34.583
And even after difficulties,

107
00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:37.208
your enthusiasm will remain.

108
00:05:37.208 --> 00:05:38.583
For this reason,

109
00:05:38.583 --> 00:05:45.333
weigh your relationships, 
your decisions in this perspective.

110
00:05:45.333 --> 00:05:49.541
Is your purpose high?

111
00:05:49.541 --> 00:05:54.333
Is there some trivial selfishness somewhere?

112
00:05:54.333 --> 00:05:59.541
And this very deep thinking
 will take you on the right path.

113
00:05:59.541 --> 00:06:02.875
Whether mutual relationships, your work,

114
00:06:02.875 --> 00:06:06.750
or your spiritual journey.

115
00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:10.833
You'll be able to walk on that path with firmness,

116
00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:17.541
and continuously a feeling of
 satisfaction will also flow in you.

117
00:06:17.541 --> 00:06:21.875
Do think about this matter.

118
00:06:26.583 --> 00:06:30.291
The depth of any relationship

119
00:06:30.291 --> 00:06:34.916
depends on the purpose hidden behind it.

120
00:06:34.916 --> 00:06:40.708
If a relationship is only because of some need,

121
00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:44.666
then isn't that a bargain?

122
00:06:44.666 --> 00:06:49.375
A process of give and take?

123
00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:52.250
Can it survive?

124
00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:53.375
No.

125
00:06:53.375 --> 00:06:56.625
Just like those people who come to Me

126
00:06:56.625 --> 00:06:59.291
because of some need,

127
00:06:59.291 --> 00:07:01.625
as soon as the need is fulfilled,

128
00:07:01.625 --> 00:07:07.041
the relationship also starts disappearing.

129
00:07:07.041 --> 00:07:11.041
True and joyful relationships

130
00:07:11.041 --> 00:07:14.333
aren't based on small needs.

131
00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:19.958
They're based on love and understanding.

132
00:07:19.958 --> 00:07:22.875
Like a jñānī,

133
00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:25.541
who has true understanding of Me,

134
00:07:25.541 --> 00:07:28.916
in whom there's love for Me.

135
00:07:28.916 --> 00:07:32.041
And for this very reason, 

136
00:07:32.041 --> 00:07:34.875
in Me too there's immense love for them.

137
00:07:34.875 --> 00:07:41.333
Relationships based on love and
 understanding are firm, don't break,

138
00:07:41.333 --> 00:07:45.500
and also give experience of immense joy.

139
00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.166
There, on the contrary,

140
00:07:48.166 --> 00:07:50.833
relationships based on needs

141
00:07:50.833 --> 00:07:53.458
can neither give deep joy

142
00:07:53.458 --> 00:07:57.291
nor survive long.

143
00:07:57.291 --> 00:08:02.000
This principle is very important in the family.

144
00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.750
If family members are connected to each other

145
00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.250
only for benefit,

146
00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.875
are connected for some help or need,

147
00:08:11.875 --> 00:08:16.583
then the relationship will also
 be hollow and temporary.

148
00:08:16.583 --> 00:08:20.916
But if they'll connect with each other

149
00:08:20.916 --> 00:08:24.666
from true heart, with love and respect,

150
00:08:24.666 --> 00:08:29.333
then the bond will be deep and permanent.

151
00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:34.250
Think, which relationship is most joyful?

152
00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:38.416
That where a child, after growing up,

153
00:08:38.416 --> 00:08:43.791
now comes to parents only 
because of their needs,

154
00:08:43.791 --> 00:08:47.500
or that relationship is joyful

155
00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:51.500
where the presence of parents
 itself gives joy to the child,

156
00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:55.708
where the purpose is only of love.

157
00:08:55.708 --> 00:08:59.291
Think, this one thing also

158
00:08:59.291 --> 00:09:05.333
connects family relationships with spirituality.

159
00:09:05.333 --> 00:09:10.041
Take the example of your closest friends.

160
00:09:10.041 --> 00:09:14.000
How much sweetness is in that friendship.

161
00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.583
But there, if selfishness

162
00:09:16.583 --> 00:09:21.083
or some motive is mixed,

163
00:09:21.083 --> 00:09:24.208
then that sweetness will disappear.

164
00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:27.875
In marriage too, it's the same.

165
00:09:27.875 --> 00:09:32.083
Love and understanding are the foundation
 of a sweet relationship.

166
00:09:32.083 --> 00:09:38.333
If the foundation shakes, then the building
 of relationship will waver and fall.

167
00:09:38.333 --> 00:09:44.625
A jñānī understands Me, loves Me,

168
00:09:44.625 --> 00:09:52.041
and for this reason, my relationship
 with them is firm, unbreakable.

169
00:09:52.041 --> 00:09:56.333
They give Me love, I to them.

170
00:09:56.333 --> 00:10:01.125
You also, in relationships, bring
 not selfishness but understanding.

171
00:10:01.125 --> 00:10:04.625
Mix not needs but love,

172
00:10:04.625 --> 00:10:12.041
and then see that you'll receive
 far more love and joy

173
00:10:12.041 --> 00:10:15.666
than what you give.

174
00:10:15.666 --> 00:10:17.750
It's a deep matter.

175
00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.833
Do think about this.

176
00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.875
A jñānī,

177
00:10:26.875 --> 00:10:29.250
with focus,

178
00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:34.041
with the excellent purpose of spirituality,

179
00:10:34.041 --> 00:10:40.416
without material selfishness, does My devotion.

180
00:10:40.416 --> 00:10:47.500
For this reason, they make supreme
 progress in the spiritual journey,

181
00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:53.000
and they're also extremely dear to Me.

182
00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.291
In professional life too,

183
00:10:55.291 --> 00:10:57.083
those who work with focus,

184
00:10:57.083 --> 00:10:59.666
with excellent purpose,

185
00:10:59.666 --> 00:11:03.500
without trivial selfishness,

186
00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:09.541
those very people become dear
 and trusted to the organization

187
00:11:09.541 --> 00:11:13.625
and their senior colleagues.

188
00:11:13.625 --> 00:11:19.458
They don't work somehow just to finish,

189
00:11:19.458 --> 00:11:24.125
but put their complete strength in it.

190
00:11:24.125 --> 00:11:27.541
They remain committed to excellence

191
00:11:27.541 --> 00:11:29.458
in their every work.

192
00:11:29.458 --> 00:11:37.458
Think, one who is working with the
 purpose of excellence without being told,

193
00:11:37.458 --> 00:11:41.000
they'll also be desirous of learning new methods,

194
00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:45.500
will also use suggestions received from others.

195
00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:48.083
Then where can progress

196
00:11:48.083 --> 00:11:51.208
remain far from such a person?

197
00:11:51.208 --> 00:11:55.833
Where on one hand their work is excellent,

198
00:11:55.833 --> 00:11:59.541
on the other hand, those people

199
00:11:59.541 --> 00:12:04.250
also become a source of inspiration for others.

200
00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:07.250
Instead of getting scared of problems,

201
00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.666
they think that

202
00:12:08.666 --> 00:12:12.500
there must be some solution to this, and then

203
00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:16.875
spend their time in search of that solution,

204
00:12:16.875 --> 00:12:20.750
not in getting troubled behind the problem.

205
00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.916
And for this reason,

206
00:12:22.916 --> 00:12:26.708
they also solve every trouble.

207
00:12:26.708 --> 00:12:29.750
Dedication to solve all problems,

208
00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:34.166
strong desire to give best results in one's work,

209
00:12:34.166 --> 00:12:40.583
and consequently others' appreciation and love.

210
00:12:40.583 --> 00:12:48.333
Think about it. Just this thought
 will fill you with positivity.
